473→                 \n\
474→                 Available tools:\n\
475→                 - engram_search: Full-text search across all captured reasoning\n\
476→                 - engram_show: Show full details of a specific engram (use \"HEAD\" for most recent)\n\
477→                 - engram_log: List recent engrams with token usage and cost\n\
478→                 - engram_trace: Reasoning history for a specific file path\n\
479→                 - engram_diff: Compare two engrams (files, tokens, cost)\n\
480→                 - engram_dead_ends: Surface rejected approaches and architectural decisions\n\
481→                 \n\
482→                 Use these tools to check prior reasoning before making changes, \
483→                 avoid repeating dead ends, and understand the history behind existing code."
484→                    .into(),
485→            ),
486→            capabilities: ServerCapabilities::builder().enable_tools().build(),
487→            ..Default::default()
488→        }
489→    }
490→}
